{"Title":"An Act to provide for the future information technology needs of Massachusetts.","BillNumber":"H4648","DocketNumber":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":null,"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"GOV7","Name":"Maura T. Healey","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/GOV7","ResponseDate":"2024-01-09T10:52:53.7"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4648/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"House bill No. 4642, as amended and passed to be engrossed by the House.  May 15, 2024.","DocumentText":null,"EmergencyPreamble":"Whereas, The deferred operation of this act would tend to defeat its purpose, which is to provide forthwith for the information technology and security needs of the commonwealth and deploy broadband access to the citizens of the commonwealth, therefore it is hereby declared to be an emergency law, necessary for the immediate preservation of the public convenience.\r\n\r\n","RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Favorable with Amendment","FiscalAmounts":[{"FiscalType":"Bond Authorization","Amount":"$1240000000.00"}],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S30","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/S30"},"Votes":[{"Question":"Ought to pass with an amendment - New Text","Bill":{"BillNumber":"H4648","DocketNumber":null,"Title":"An Act to provide for the future information technology needs of Massachusetts.","PrimarySponsor":null,"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"GOV7","Name":"Maura T. Healey","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/GOV7","ResponseDate":"2024-01-09T10:52:53.7"}],"JointSponsor":null,"GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4648","IsDocketBookOnly":false},"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"S30","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.